      "anim": "idle",
      "duration": 7.9,
      "volume": 0.92
    },
    {
      "at": 24.2,
      "type": "line",
      "actor": "pierce",
      "speaker": "Pierce",
      "text": "It looked like a creature. Not a chart. Not a leak. Something with a shape it should not have, sitting on a terminal in my tower.",
      "audio": "/assets/audio/cutscenes/elevator-b3/04-pierce-creature.wav",
      "anim": "idle",
      "duration": 9.75,
      "volume": 0.92
    },
    {
      "at": 34.9,
      "type": "line",
      "actor": "pierce",
      "speaker": "Pierce",
      "text": "Hawkes sells dominance. Clean floors. Locked basements. We do not put animals on a fifty-eighth-floor screen and call it operations.",
